silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_02_sections_02_yoneda_hom_leg_1 silm:hasExample "In 'MicrochipReadStageStepYonedaHomLeg1', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, designates : MicrochipIdentifier9 -> Mittens; the new cocone leg admitted by the chip read; monic at the identifier source" .
